[
  {
    "id": "sctp_t1_baseline_assoc",
    "proto": "sctp",
    "summary": "T-1 基线关联：4 握手+3 关闭=7 帧，chunk_type 序 1/2/10/11/7/8/14",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "sctp": {
            "src_port": 12345,
            "dst_port": 5000
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": false,
      "negotiated": false,
      "terminates": false,
      "packet_count": 7,
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 46,
          "hex": "0b 00 00 04"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "包数实测钉 7；f4 COOKIE-ACK=纯 4B 头 0b 00 00 04（chunk 起点 offset 46=eth14+ip20+SCTP 公共头 12）",
        "SCTP 无 TCP 握手/挥手——has_handshake/terminates 不适用；7 帧=INIT/INIT-ACK/COOKIE-ECHO/COOKIE-ACK/SHUTDOWN/SHUTDOWN-ACK/SHUTDOWN-COMPLETE（RFC 4960 §5.1/§9.2）；端口住 sctp 层（1.12 补位）",
        "端口选 5000（中性）：38412(NGAP)/2905(M3UA) 端口与 PPID 60(NGAP) 等现网特征值都会触发 tshark 启发式 dissector 对任意载荷误报 Malformed——用例取非启发 PPID 保证字节断言面干净；现网 PPID 语义（NGAP=60/S1AP=24）在 D-SCTP-1 P1 矩阵注记"
      ],
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "sctp.srcport",
          "value": "12345"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "sctp.dstport",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "10"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "11"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "7"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "8"
        },
        {
          "packet": 7,
          "field": "sctp.chunk_type",
          "value": "14"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "sctp_t2_handshake_bytes",
    "proto": "sctp",
    "summary": "T-2 4 握手字节钉：INIT VTag=0/cookie 回显一致/COOKIE-ACK 4B",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "sctp": {
            "src_port": 12345,
            "dst_port": 5000,
            "verification_tag": 305419896,
            "initiate_tag": 2271560481
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": false,
      "negotiated": false,
      "terminates": false,
      "packet_count": 7,
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "offset": 38,
          "hex": "00 00 00 00"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "offset": 46,
          "hex": "01 00 00 14"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "offset": 38,
          "hex": "12 34 56 78"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "offset": 46,
          "hex": "02 00 00 38"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "offset": 38,
          "hex": "87 65 43 21"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "offset": 66,
          "hex": "00 07 00 24"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "offset": 46,
          "hex": "0a 00 00 24"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 46,
          "hex": "0b 00 00 04"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 38,
          "hex": "12 34 56 78"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "追加：显式双 Tag（verification_tag=0x12345678/initiate_tag=0x87654321，逐键反查补覆盖）→VTag 公共头（offset 38）确定性可钉",
        "VTag 实测钉（offset 38）：f1 INIT=0（RFC 4960 §5.1.1）/f2 INIT-ACK 用 client Tag 12345678/f3 COOKIE-ECHO 用 server Tag 87654321（=initiate_tag）/f4 COOKIE-ACK 用 client Tag——双 Tag 显式后 VTag 语义逐帧可验",
        "确定性字节钉（offset 46=chunk 起点）：f1 INIT 01 00 00 14（VTag 位置=0 per RFC 4960 §5.1.1；initiateTag/TSN 随机不钉）/f2 INIT-ACK 02 00 00 38+cookie 参数头 00 07 00 24（offset 66）/f3 COOKIE-ECHO 0a 00 00 24/f4 COOKIE-ACK 0b 00 00 04",
        "cookie 32B 每轮随机（rand.Read）——回显一致性静态钉不可为，由 legacy 单测钉（cookie echo 相等断言）；INIT-ACK len 56=16 头+36 cookie 参数"
      ]
    }
  },
